# K60-K64 (2026-10-23, docs/RULINGS_2026-10-23.md): A-LOOP's approval and fiscal terms re-measured on the build that seeds the pre-run fiscal years
# (K62), gates each year on the government's tenure (K63), reads the robust spread and caps the term at +/-10 pp (K64). Read with
# perl Tools/audit/aloop_record_check.pl <the run's log> <its night folder>: every RECORD line's approval term against 0.16 x its net change
# (K60), its fiscal term against sigma_v x delta-z recomputed from its own BAL-i, and K61's change reading; the governing side's seats on each
# night printed as a reading.
#
